        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CIRGEO, Circulaire Rose with Georgetown Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Stylish Georgetown Lever is a stunning piece of hardware fit for any space. The Circulaire Rose with the Georgetown Lever has a classic beauty. Choose from several different finishes including polished nickel and brass. The Georgetown Leverset with Circulaire Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions; and it can fit 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. It is easy to install, and since it is made by Grandeur, the Circulaire Rose with Georgetown Lever has a lifetime mechanical warranty. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur CIRGEO Georgetown Lever with Circulaire Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Stylish Georgetown Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CIRGEO-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262326\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur CIRGEO Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Stylish Georgetown Lever with Circulaire Rose",
                "description": "Grandeur CIRGEO, Georgetown Lever With Circulaire Rosette - The Traditional Georgetown Lever is a stunning piece of hardware fit for any space. The Circulaire Rose with the Georgetown Lever has a classic beauty. Choose from several different finishes including polished nickel and brass. The Georgetown Leverset with Circulaire Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions; and it can fit 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. It is easy to install, and since it is made by Grandeur, the Circulaire Rose with Georgetown Lever has a lifetime mechanical warranty.",
                "keywords": "Georgetown Leverset with Circulaire Roses, GRA-CIRGEO, Grandeur CIRGEO, Georgetown Lever With Circulaire Rosettes, Traditional Georgetown Levers, Traditional Georgetown Levers,  Circulaire Rose with Georgetown Levers,"
